{#
  BeMart withdrawal final-confirmation page — EC-CUBE
  goMypageWithdrawConfirm.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Mypage/withdraw_confirm.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Mypage/withdraw_confirm.twig).

  This is the SECOND withdrawal screen — EC-CUBE renders it after the
  warning page (`Mypage/withdraw.twig`, ported as
  `Page/Mypage/Withdraw.html.twig`) is submitted with `mode=confirm`.
  It asks the final "退会手続きを実行してもよろしいでしょうか？"
  confirmation, with a cancel link + an execute button POSTing
  `mode=complete` to actually withdraw.

  Markup skeleton, `ec-mypageRole` / `ec-pageHeader` /
  `ec-withdrawConfirmRole` / `ec-off3Grid` / `ec-off4Grid` /
  `ec-withdrawConfirmRole__title` / `ec-withdrawConfirmRole__description`
  / `ec-withdrawConfirmRole__cancel` classes + the block structure are
  kept verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  Mypage/navi.twig -> the shared partial `Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig`.

  This is a CONFIRM screen — it has NO editable form FIELDS, only a
  cancel link, a submit button and a CSRF hidden token. EC-CUBE emits the
  token via `{{ form_widget(form._token) }}` (the Symfony CSRF widget);
  BeMart has no CSRF widget, so the hidden `_token` input is authored
  plainly with the body's `csrfToken` value (null in the html context —
  the EventListener mirrors the live token in for the POST). Because the
  confirm page carries no editable fields, no AbstractForm is needed (the
  form-page recipe's `<Name>Form` exists for screens that render
  `<input>` fields) — same call as `Page/Mypage/Withdraw.html.twig`.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}` -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `asset('x')` -> `/x` passthrough (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - The Mypage navi welcome line reads `name01`/`name02`; the
     WithdrawConfirm resource is a thin pure renderer with no
     session-bound customer context, so the name is a MISSING BODY FIELD
     follow-up — the welcome renders the empty name.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'mypage' %}
{% set route = 'mypage-withdraw-confirm' %}
{% set title = 'マイページ' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-layoutRole__main">
        <div class="ec-mypageRole">
            <div class="ec-pageHeader">
                <h1>マイページ/退会手続き</h1>
            </div>
            {% include 'Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig' with { mypageno: 'withdraw', name01: name01|default(''), name02: name02|default('') } %}
        </div>
        <div class="ec-mypageRole">
            <div class="ec-withdrawConfirmRole">
                <div class="ec-off3Grid">
                    <div class="ec-off3Grid__cell">
                        <div style="font-size:100px;text-align:center;">
                            <div class="ec-icon"><img src="{{ asset('assets/icon/exclamation.svg') }}" alt=""></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="ec-withdrawConfirmRole__title">退会手続きを実行してもよろしいでしょうか？</p>
                        <p class="ec-withdrawConfirmRole__description">退会手続きが完了した時点で、現在保存されている購入履歴やお届け先等の情報は、すべて削除されますのでご注意ください。
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <form method="post" action="/mypage/withdraw">
                    <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                    <div class="ec-off4Grid">
                        <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell">
                            <a class="ec-withdrawConfirmRole__cancel ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="/mypage">
                                いいえ、退会しません
                            </a>
                            <button type="submit" class="ec-blockBtn" name="mode"
                                    value="complete">はい、退会します
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
